      "name": "Blood pressure medications",
      "char_file": "혈압계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First, blood pressure",
        "medications",
        "",
        "They can trigger",
        "orthostatic hypotension —",
        "a sudden BP drop",
        "when you stand"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rise slowly from bed or chair",
      "char_file": "이불_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Sit on the edge",
        "for a few seconds",
        "before standing",
        "",
        "especially first thing",
        "in the morning"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Benzodiazepines and sleep aids",
      "char_file": "시계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second, sleep aids",
        "and benzodiazepines",
        "",
        "Effects can linger",
        "well into the next day,",
        "slowing your reactions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Adjust timing and move carefully at night",
      "char_file": "이불_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Turn on the lights",
        "for nighttime",
        "bathroom trips",
        "",
        "Ask your doctor about",
        "an earlier dose",
        "if grogginess lingers"
      ]
